# C41 — API Client

Phase: P09 (re-cut, D059). Status: planned. Required predecessor: C40.

## Outcome

The screen matches its prototype board side by side at 1440×900 in light and dark with real core data, as the owner approved from the chunk's composites, and passes its gate at 8.

## The board

R2App `start=api`. The frozen prototype under `docs/architecture/ui-v2/prototype/` is the specification; `docs/planning/p09-recut.md` states the bar.

## Regions to port

title row with Collection and Environment chips; a 286px request tree with search; open-request tabs; the method/URL line with Send; request sub-tabs with a params table; a 40% response pane (340–440px) with status, Response tabs and pretty/raw body; history from the workbench; the completion status region with the body outside it. New components over the workbench intents; `WorkbenchView` and the legacy editor are not imported.

## Core it reads

`ShellSnapshot.workbench`, workbench requests (`openFolder`, `openRequest`, `send`, `apply`, `history`, `showRun`, …) and `observeWorkbench`. No new core capability unless named here; v2 components import no legacy feature view.

## Parity

Composites at `docs/planning/evidence/C41/parity/<board>-<theme>.png` (prototype left, app right) with `notes.md` listing accessibility deviations; the owner's approval is recorded there before the gate.

## Gate

Rebuild, native acceptance (C41-N01 tree, tabs, request line, response pane, history; C41-N02 Send by keyboard with the announced completion; C41-N03 keyboard, ring, 900×600 at 200% both themes), the full desktop-core fixture suite and the Codex review; accepted at 8 (D032/D034), raised to 9 in C44.

## Tests

`ui_v2_api` (the C33 immutable-history tests move or stay registered); Vitest `v2/workbench/api-client.test.tsx`.

